    "description": "subjectId is a response/snapshot-scoped projection key, never lifecycle identity. identity is established only from proven occurrence + construction boundaries. Unknown expiration remains represented; remainingDte null means unavailable. Clients do not reconstruct membership, identity, quantities or payoff."
